    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giishealda roopta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghoapkaat ASEETA Nuhu ea diyeanga sean ea dugwa sean mideayeesa niny jeeda maleambooda. Ng'ata ghwanung' ASEETA ghaghuudu jeameeda aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ak ghwasuunyaada beega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwatkweada seawuutka sheagi jih mida uuta ng'eanyiida nea seawuutka humng'eeda geedukuta, ak geateal roopta leabu humng'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghwasuunyaada beega mida badayda ng'eanyiida giliwas eaweecha. Ng'ata askwearjooji bughala ea haradam ea damanamughuush goosha beega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iimuchu eaweeteaba damanispwa bea sheedeaba ispwa, ghwahiing'aan maleambooda ea ghamiinaada aba uhuuda giijeeda siguura Ararati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooshealeada beega ea ghwahita sheedeaba damanamughuush; hita sheedeaba damanamughuush, sing'usha sheeda, geadaah iheenga giijeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata askwearjooji haradam ghwajaat Nuhu seawadeeda maleambooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooruuta udaghuuh; ak ghang'eata ak gwaneayi ea ghwajaam beega aba badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iimuchu gwasiksa ghariibajeanda, ghwadaah beega ea niisha aba badayda ng'eanyiida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mwanyasa ghariibajeanda heechea goobissa, ak gabiikta jeeda maleambooda, aba gideaba gudugwadukuta beega ng'eanyiisean. Ng'ata ghoahaakta geadi ak ghoang'waay ghariibajeanda ak goodeelsa jeeda maleambooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goomeas askwearjooji ispwa, ak gabiikta gooruuta ghariibajeanda aba jeeda maleambooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gabiigu ghariibajeanda shing'ada headaanyi, asee anda gweana ghuuta seendooda nyawiish loodu bea geeta siguura saytuunajeanda; hean gwajeeng'u Nuhu gideaba nisuunya beega aba badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabassa askwearjooji ispwa suuk, ak gooruuta gicha ghariibajeanda; ak ea mudu gabiigu headaanyi gicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iihita gweaydeaba bughalaji lah ea agi, sheeda madeeda, eaweecheanda madeeda bea sheeda, ghwajaam beega aba badayda ng'eanyiida; ak ghwajaat Nuhu uhuuda maleambooda, ak ghoang'wearda, ak ging'ulayi, badayda ng'eanyiida ea ghajaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeteaba diktam ea ispwa bea sheedeaba iyeenya, ea nighajaamiit ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwayeesha ASEETA Nuhu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riteawana jeeda maleambooda, ang'iing'i sea gatmoadaang'u, ea orjoagaagu sea gadeemga orjoagaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruuta gilinyoo mideawana mideawa ea weega dariidaka ea diyeanga ea diyeanga badiina jeeda aba badayda ng'eanyiida ak abeeda gwaji muuchi aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ak goojiili ak ghoasaang'ayiichi aba badayda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hit ghang'eat Nuhu gwarita sea gatmoadaanyi, ea orjoagaaschi sea gadeemga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea giliwas diyeayda, ea giliwas diyeayda badiina jeeda, ea giliwas dariideanda, ea gilinyoo gabadiini aba badayda ng'eanyiida, gwarita aba jeeda maleambooda nea goodeaydooschi aba heeluutka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nuhu ghoadayda lukghumeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gwasin Nuhu heeda wagiida aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gageanu gilinyoo ea diyeayda miy gil ea gilinyoo ea dariideanda miy gil, ak ghoadayda ghoah lukghumajeega sighwarda aba heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joon NG'UTAMIIDA shearooda ng'andit bea lukghumajeega, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda gurooroadaanyi, “Maygudu damwaashta ng'eanyiida aba badayda siida, aba gideaba giiteemshajeega siida aba jeeda gurooroadaanyi ea munyas ghang'eada jeepcheanduumeadaanyi; ak ea maygudu danuus giliwas diyeayda gawuurji gidaghayi easindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iigudugwanda ng'eanyiida, gaygwanda damanda histeayda ea dea lajita, ak iissa gaygwanda jeameeda ea daknooda, ak gaygwanda geayda ea damanda gooroogeeda, askweari ea eawa, nea maygamuudean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
